 p\u00e9trole et du gaz. Essayez de percer, d'ajustez des vannes pour maintenir la pression et envoyez un assistant robotique unique, Appo, sur le terrain pour rechercher les dangers. Testez-vous pour savoir quelles professions vous conviennent le mieux dans l'industrie canadienne de l'\u00e9nergie.", "short_description": "Jouez \u00e0 une s\u00e9rie de mini-jeux amusants pour voir comment vos comp\u00e9tences s'alignent sur 10 carri\u00e8res excitants dans l'industrie du p\u00e9trole et du gaz."}]}, "developer_name": "MAMMOTH XR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://careersinoilandgas.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://mammothxr.com/", "publisher_name": "MAMMOTH XR", "support_website_url": "https://mammothxr.com/", "website_url": "https://careersinoilandgas.com/experience-the-energy/take-the-challenge/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "327181149297928"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031524_630595944422264_7035436368226418688_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LEFAOshtqpgQ7kNvwGTG3vm&_nc_oc=Adr1z5az0kc9RNp9ES_fb1pEaDgndaPfsdhRZTotD-ilxNLJ33r3i_fA6d5PpLOwad0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRM19BTlsvYuSBTmeDFfTLqRGpYxnzdPYZjLpK0qotHsA&oe=6AFDCA01"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": fa